1VGRFNVRQ==","review_photo_ids":["CIABIhC4hX6-Xs_tTuI4GbByrT9v"],"review_questions":{"Atmosphere":"5","Food":"5","Order type":"Take out","Service":"5"},"review_rating":5,"review_text":"Delicious cream puffs, cheese tarts, and crepe cakes and very friendly staffs! Oh and did I say the owner is super talented and creative with coming up with all these amazing new flavours and recipes constantly?! Best dessert place in town!","review_timestamp":1769094955,"reviews_id":"428630540242476037"},{"author_id":"115374160519377687526","author_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsPSIjerC7jPtPynL9C5kBRrcNG1-WEWVeHVvjcFkgib4tE0D-=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","author_link":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115374160519377687526?hl=en","author_ratings_count":2,"author_reviews_count":3,"author_title":"stephenyctse","google_id":"0x52ea7136d978a159:0x5f2cd3493095c05","owner_answer":null,"owner_answer_timestamp":null,"owner_answer_timestamp_datetime_utc":null,"review_datetime_utc":"01/22/2026 04:02:20","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxWldraG5WRU4yTVZrM1VrczFUVjh5YlZoNWNFRRAB","review_img_url":null,"review_img_urls":null,"review_likes":null,"review_link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxWldraG5WRU4yTVZrM1VrczFUVjh5YlZoNWNFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x5f2cd3493095c05!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOi1ZWkhnVEN2MVk3Uks1TV8ybVh5cEE%7C%7C?hl=en","review_pagination_id":"CAESY0NBRVFCUnBFUTJwRlNVRlNTWEJEWjI5QlVEY3lSMUZqU1dWM2JGOWZSV2hFUmw5d1ZqQnFSMnRvUm5WMU9FaFNVVUZCUVVGQlIyZHVPVEpSTkVOYVFuZG9OME5WV1VGRFNVRQ==","review_photo_ids":null,"review_questions":{"Atmosphere":"1","Food":"4","Order type":"Take out","Price per person":"$1\u201310","Reservation":"Reservation required","Service":"1"},"review_rating":1,"review_text":"I've been a loyal regular since July 2025, pre-ordering reliably via Instagram DM every few weeks (5-6 cream puffs + other pastries), with no prior mentions of changes in DMs or pickups.\n\nThis week, for 3 limited-edition desserts (final week) on Wednesday, I learned same-day pre-orders now require phone call, not DM. No public announcement, no IG post/story/bio update, despite months of opportunities to inform.\n\nTheir response acknowledged the change started earlier, they tried to \"accommodate\" frequent customers (leading to confusion), and admitted \"we should've informed you before.\" While the \"accommodation\" framing feels off (I never requested special treatment; the old system just worked), their apology and promise to internally discuss improvements are appreciated.\n\nStill, the unannounced shift meant missing out, if shared openly earlier, I'd have pre-ordered ahead. Uncertainty remains high: rules could change again secretly (e.g., no same-day holds soon), forcing constant calls to confirm. Planning ahead is impossible without notice, especially for working folks.\n\nThe pastries are excellent and why I've supported so long, but consistent communication is key. Hopefully their internal discussion leads to clearer policies (e.g., public announcements for changes). I'll watch for improvements, if communication gets better, I'd consider returning.\n\nPotential customers: Confirm ordering rules via call, as they can shift without broad notice.","review_timestamp":1769054540,"reviews_id":"428630540242476037"},{"author_id":"105088132159770643183","author_image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUFUxQDeOplgXyEFkyB6Lm88ecYX-FhiuCn2WEXcdkjtF4wd9pi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100","author_link":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105088132159770643183?hl=en","author_ratings_count":0,"author_reviews_count":81,"author_title":"Jamie Lee","google_id":"0x52ea7136d978a159:0x5f2cd3493095c05","owner_answer":null,"owner_answer_timestamp":null,"owner_answer_timestamp_datetime_utc":null,"review_datetime_utc":"01/21/2026 03:00:46","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOSGVWQkxiMWN3Tms1V01uTmtNUzFSU0dGbFZFRRAB","review_img_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc-cs/AMG9lEQWgFzoG